[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15132.99, "timestamp": "04:12:12", "text": "顶部。可以坐在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15136.229, "timestamp": "04:12:16", "text": "放松一下，看看那里的大海，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15139.429, "timestamp": "04:12:19", "text": "赶紧去晒日光浴吧，因为你已经到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15141.269, "timestamp": "04:12:21", "text": "现在，大海。你必须得到你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15145.189, "timestamp": "04:12:25", "text": "因为树木太多，现在阳光很充足。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15147.269, "timestamp": "04:12:27", "text": "你一直都处于阴凉处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15149.59, "timestamp": "04:12:29", "text": "是的，你需要晒太阳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15152.67, "timestamp": "04:12:32", "text": "去晒晒太阳吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15155.75, "timestamp": "04:12:35", "text": "东西。想象一下，它曾经是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15159.11, "timestamp": "04:12:39", "text": "可以把日光浴之类的东西放进去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15161.91, "timestamp": "04:12:41", "text": "嗯，我想应该有一个吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15164.55, "timestamp": "04:12:44", "text": "我想我是在我所在的那个岛上看到它的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15168.87, "timestamp": "04:12:48", "text": "像普通的椅子，而不是椅子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15176.51, "timestamp": "04:12:56", "text": "哦，有战斗……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15179.269, "timestamp": "04:12:59", "text": "嗯，这就是全部的舰船信息了。"}]